<title>LEBANON: Slight earth tremor shakes south Lebanon.</title>
<headline>Slight earth tremor shakes south Lebanon.</headline>
<dateline>MARJAYOUN, Lebanon 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A slight earth tremor shook south Lebanon on Thursday but caused no damage or injuries, residents said. The quake was felt for about one second by inhabitants of Israel's south Lebanon occupation zone.</p>
</text>
